WEBVTT

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.040
What the hell's...

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.770
up with that messed up face of yers?

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.540
Nekota-san!

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:18.750
<i>Now I remember.</i>

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.450
<i>It's because of these two.</i>

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:22.780
<i>What am I fighting for?</i>

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:25.450
<i>I don't want to lose!</i>

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:29.230
<i>Both Nekota and Yuki-san have always been fighting...</i>

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:33.210
<i>the fear of what's happening to their bodies.</i>

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:36.980
<i>The hell with my training.</i>

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:39.340
<i>I've been taking things way too easy.</i>

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:43.310
<i>I don't want to lose to their magnificence.</i>

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:46.600
<i>I will... fight to the bitter end!</i>

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:51.720
Yew look... absolutely pathetic!

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:53.020
What're you...

00:00:54.560 --> 00:01:00.320
I'm gonna... fire yew up!

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:06.740
This is gonna hurt!

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:16.790
Shit!

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:21.220
That took... all the strength I had!

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:27.390
Your... Your lighting fast punch is now...

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:29.900
But...

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.150
That got me good, Nekota!

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:35.650
I never felt a punch that hurt like that!

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:38.900
That fired me up!

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:42.410
Be careful!

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:47.500
Being fired up... won't win yew... this fight!

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.410
Huh? Then what will?

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:52.920
Take... Take his right...

00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:56.290
and don't shut yer eyes, yew gutless wonder!

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:00.450
<i>Take his right?</i>

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:03.820
<i>But his left hand put me down countless times.</i>

00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:05.550
<i>If I take his full right...</i>

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:11.310
<i>So I'm a gutless wonder, huh?</i>

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:15.100
<i>I'll take it with pride! You better collect my remains!</i>

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:19.170
Nekota.

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:22.610
Even if you did fire him up, he's still a dead man walking!

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:29.580
But I can't stand to see him twisting in the wind.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.750
I have to stop this fight!

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.590
Then stop it!

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:37.460
Don't blame me if he decides to kill yew after.

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:45.840
<i>It's iron!</i>

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:48.850
<i>His will is made of solid stuff, just like iron!</i>

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:52.850
<i>Even if he's still barely conscious, he'll rise and come swinging!</i>

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:55.630
<i>The only way to spare him...</i>

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:58.860
<i>is to put out his lights with the ultimate weapon!</i>

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.610
<i>Still hanging on to that straw?!</i>

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:04.780
<i>N-Not yet!</i>

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:07.030
<i>You're still alive?!</i>

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:08.720
<i>And kicking!</i>

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:15.460
<i>They lack the speed, but those hits are making the Sarge wince in pain.</i>

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:19.170
<i>Only he knows exactly how much power they pack!</i>

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:22.340
<i>He's feeling his iron will through those fists!</i>

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:25.260
<i>Those iron fists!</i>

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:28.090
Not done yet!

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.850
Whoa! He's daunted by his drive!

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:38.250
If yew've... ever had to fight Kamogawa...

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:39.560
yew can tell.

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:46.650
That's... Kamogawa's weapon right there.

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:51.370
His iron will... that gets the job done!

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:52.370
Yeah.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:56.620
He's not even afraid to die as long as he gets what he wants.

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:59.850
In other words, courage!

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:01.880
That's his weapon!

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:09.390
<i>That guy's all but done for!</i>

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:13.510
<i>This fight's almost finished, 
so there's no room for any blunders.</i>

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:15.840
<i>It's time to end this!</i>

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:18.060
<i>Take it to him, Sarge!</i>

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:20.980
<i>Kamogawa-san!</i>

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:25.750
<i>I... ain't gutless!</i>

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:27.860
Kamogawa?

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:30.020
<i>Goddammit...</i>

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:31.920
<i>I'm not blacking out!</i>

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:34.790
<i>I'll get in there and poleax his belly!</i>

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:38.820
<i>He's got a low stance.</i>

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:40.920
<i>So when the chance comes, strike down...</i>

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:42.380
<i>With my right!</i>

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:44.580
<i>Crap!</i>

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:46.050
<i>Here comes the missile!</i>

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.610
<i>I'm gonna eat it straight on!</i>

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:49.380
Don't close yer eyes!

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:51.640
As long as yew got yer courage...

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.260
yew can do it!

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:56.770
<i>You asshole!</i>

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:00.340
<i>His belly...</i>

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:01.770
<i>It's wide open!</i>

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:05.020
Kamogawa!

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.570
What the?

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:11.530
He withstood it!

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:13.530
<i>Unbelievable.</i>

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:20.880
<i>If I didn't receive Nekota's punch... 
I wouldn't be standing...</i>

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:24.290
<i>Compared to the pain of Nekota's fist...</i>

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:26.800
<i>this is nothing, American!</i>

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:28.960
<i>You're giving me too much trouble.</i>

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:31.430
<i>In order to end this, I have to...</i>

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.930
<i>put out your lights for good!</i>

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.850
<i>Nekota realized something...</i>

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:40.600
<i>Whenever you come with your right, your belly's wide open!</i>

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:44.110
<i>I'll pound you six feet under, with my right fist!</i>

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:48.480
<i>Come on, your secret's now exposed!</i>

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:50.650
<i>He's waiting for that punch!</i>

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:52.450
Stop, Sarge!

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.870
<i>I can even see your internal organs!</i>

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:03.620
<i>He got him first! Is this it?!</i>

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:07.380
Kamogawa!

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:11.830
If yew fall, yew'll never get up!

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:14.720
Stay up, yew dumbass!

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:28.050
The guy was so scared he pulled his punch.

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:31.020
That ain't gonna put Kamogawa down!

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:32.200
Still...

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:33.700
Nekota-san?

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:37.150
Go get him!

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:40.740
<i>That's a tall order, Nekota...</i>

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:44.960
<i>I'm having trouble just staying awake.</i>

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:49.240
<i>I'll be honest, his punches ain't weak.</i>

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:53.510
<i>American boxing is truly mindblowing.</i>

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:54.770
Kamogawa-san!

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:59.220
Nekota-san is still fighting, so you have to fight too!

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:02.220
Beat him!

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:07.030
<i>He dragged his carcass all the way over here.</i>

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:09.990
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:13.990
<i>He came to tell me something he learned in his deathmatch.</i>

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:16.190
<i>He risked his life to tell me this!</i>

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:18.990
<i>If I let it go to waste...</i>

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:20.440
<i>I'm not a man!</i>

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:27.410
I was afraid he took a body blow, but the Sarge is A-OK.

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:32.130
But if things get dicey, he can still hit him in the back of the head.

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:34.480
With his rabbit punch.

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:35.380
No, he won't!

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:39.290
Our sergeant will not throw another illegal punch!

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:42.640
He's practiced his ass off for this fight!

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:48.900
Right now, the blood of a genuine boxer is flowing through his veins!

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:52.650
As a boxer with pride, he will not use an illegal hit!

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:55.650
That's why I agreed to be his second!

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:59.780
It's now or never, Sarge! Focus!

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:04.580
<i>I'll admit it. He's a tough little nip.</i>

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:08.550
<i>And it's all the more reason to avoid a judge's decision!</i>

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:12.290
<i>I am going to take him down using the pride and resolve...</i>

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:14.090
<i>of real American boxing!</i>

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:22.920
<i>Good, he's moving in.</i>

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.100
<i>Kamogawa-san.</i>

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:27.350
<i>This is it.</i>

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:33.610
He stopped him with his left! He'll come down with a right!

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:36.820
<i>Stay awake... Open your eyes!</i>

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:41.450
<i>Here it comes! There's his right!</i>

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:44.140
<i>And there's his open belly!</i>

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:45.830
Hit it!

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:50.290
<i>I know what you're going for, so have at my abs!</i>

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:53.080
<i>I've already made them rock hard.</i>

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:58.170
<i>If a little pain is all it takes to beat him, all the better!</i>

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:05.540
<i>It's slipping on the blood!</i>

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:07.390
<i>Is he still awake?</i>

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:11.310
<i>There's still light in his eyes!</i>

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:12.900
<i>Stomach it!</i>

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:28.660
Blood? From his fist?!

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:31.720
<i>There goes my left hand.</i>

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:32.670
<i>However!</i>

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:36.200
<i>I still got another!</i>

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:38.140
<i>He broke my body in half!</i>

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.170
<i>If he hits my jaw, it's over!</i>

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:42.180
<i>Not good... not good... not good!</i>

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:43.930
Sarge! Your guard!

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:48.210
<i>Where is he?</i>

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:50.390
<i>Why? Why isn't he coming?!</i>

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:52.900
<i>H-He's... down there?!</i>

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:54.690
Another body blow?

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:30.410
Two body blows!

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:32.430
My God... Get up, please!

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:38.390
<i>I also shattered my right hand.</i>

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:42.440
<i>That's the last of my bullets.</i>

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:46.850
<i>If he gets up... I'm through.</i>

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:57.660
Don't move him! His fractured ribs are lacerating his organs!

00:10:57.660 --> 00:10:58.400
Sarge!

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:00.210
This is really bad. Get the stretcher!

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:06.470
There's no continuing this match.

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:09.700
Hold your head up with pride.

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:10.970
This is...

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.100
your win!

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:17.340
He won!

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:19.870
Am I dreaming? He beat America!

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:21.360
Japan is victorious!

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:25.610
<i>So he broke both of his fists?</i>

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:30.960
<i>But judging from that blood, they weren't damaged from those two hits alone.</i>

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:36.650
You must have seriously injured your fists way before this match.

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:40.880
<i>Now I see why he didn't aim for his hard jaw.</i>

00:11:41.650 --> 00:11:44.970
<i>He actually fought this match with a pair of messed up fists...</i>

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:47.890
<i>I never foresaw something so utterly insane.</i>

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:51.650
<i>Japan still has a long way to go in terms of boxing.</i>

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:52.640
<i>But...</i>

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:57.150
<i>the one who will put the fear of God into American boxers...</i>

00:11:57.150 --> 00:12:00.270
<i>might be someone who will share this same blood.</i>

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.440
<i>This blood of a samurai.</i>

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:22.220
Kamogawa! You all right?

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:25.840
You magnificent bastard! You hear me, Kamogawa?!

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:30.390
You won! You've won this fight!

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:33.140
For god's sake...

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:34.090
Huh?

00:12:34.930 --> 00:12:36.880
This doesn't feel right...

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:38.110
What was that?

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:44.130
<i>I wasn't supposed to do it... Right?</i>

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:49.410
<i>If I was only relying on my own strength...</i>

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.550
<i>I don't think I would have won.</i>

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:09.970
You're really leaving?

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:11.610
Yeah.

00:13:11.610 --> 00:13:16.850
Yew took out that damn GI, so I'm leaving with a clear mind.

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:20.850
We'll get us a dog and have us a gay ol' time.

00:13:20.850 --> 00:13:21.930
Is that so?

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:25.450
Make sure you let your hands heal.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:26.610
Right.

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:29.860
Yew sure about this, Yuki-san?

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:37.090
As yew can see, I now have a tough time buttoning a shirt.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:43.130
I do want yew to come with me. But...

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:44.740
Not out of pity.

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:48.900
Decide for yerself if yew really want to come.

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:58.140
What's wrong? The train's about to leave.

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:06.900
Let me say something, before I leave.

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:10.320
Kamogawa-san, I-

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:21.480
I... I may need a lot more training.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.170
But at least I realized some things.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:28.460
The joy of making it somewhere through sheer effort.

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:32.780
The gratitude for those who supported you after a win.

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:36.710
Boxing is too awesome!

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:39.680
I'm never going to leave this sport!

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:49.300
I'm making boxing my mistress for life!

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:51.610
I love her and no one else!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:09.120
That's the Kamogawa-san I know.

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:14.170
I knew this was how you'd break off with me.

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:18.900
I'll go with Nekota-san.

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:24.140
I'll spend my remaining years by his side.

00:15:30.770 --> 00:15:31.780
Bye.

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:32.850
Remember...

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.490
Remember what you said one time?

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:41.480
Sunflowers may wilt, but they leave a lot of seeds.

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.280
American boxing was really awesome.

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:48.800
I'm honestly smitten with it.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:51.190
I want to spend the rest of my life learning it.

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:56.780
But today's medicine will never fully heal these fists.

00:15:56.780 --> 00:16:00.820
My life as an active boxer ends here. I'm practically wilted.

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.270
But...

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:04.850
I'll spread my seeds!

00:16:07.390 --> 00:16:11.110
I'll teach other young boxers what me and Nekota have learned!

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:17.240
And... if one of them conquers the world with the fists I bequeathed to him...

00:16:17.900 --> 00:16:20.370
I promise to come tell you myself!

00:16:28.510 --> 00:16:31.630
Until then, take care!

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:37.130
Y-Yuki-san?

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:39.620
Gosh, you buttoned this all wrong!

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:41.640
Yeah, what happened?

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.890
I can't let you fend for yourself.

00:16:59.150 --> 00:16:59.950
Kamogawa!

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:04.450
We still have our score to settle!

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:08.960
I'm taking yew on once we're healed up!

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:17.960
Right on!

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:53.760
Well, I feel that I only fulfilled half of the promise of conquering the world.

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:56.710
Huh? But what about Takamura-san?

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:59.720
I hate to admit it, but the guy's a damn natural.

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:05.290
He would've probably conquered the world with or without me.

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:07.720
Strictly speaking,

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:11.460
I didn't coach a world champion.

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:17.150
I believe I only ran a gym that happened to have a world champion.

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:19.320
That's a complicated way of looking at it.

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:22.320
What he wants is a true successor.

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:27.560
Takamura done got to where he is using the fists he was born with.

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:30.960
If yer asking if Gen-chan sired those fists...

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:31.900
Mm-hmm.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:37.500
<i>He made boxing his mistress, huh?</i>

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:39.980
<i>Your story really moved me.</i>

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:45.050
<i>I don't know if I can push myself the way our coach did back then.</i>

00:18:45.050 --> 00:18:49.560
<i>But I will always follow our coach, whom I love and respect.</i>

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:53.120
<i>Yuki-san, yew best keep this in mind.</i>

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:57.810
<i>Those hands folded before yew are the fists he promised yew.</i>

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:02.210
<i>They belong to Makunouchi Ippo.</i>

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:06.260
<i>He's spent many a decade spreading his seeds.</i>

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:10.080
<i>We still don't know how they'll blossom...</i>

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:15.850
<i>but this man right here, he's certainly inherited Gen-chan's fists.</i>

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:18.460
Lemme do a prayer!

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:19.460
Uh, okay.

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:21.910
<i>I'm really moved, Yuki-san.</i>

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:27.470
<i>It looks like both the coach and Nekota-san will soon join you, so look after them.</i>

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:30.610
<i>That man there is Aoki Masaru.</i>

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:31.770
<i>But...</i>

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:33.980
No need to remember him.

00:19:34.470 --> 00:19:35.490
You say something?

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:36.810
None of yer concern!

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:42.770
I'll report in again once I've fulfilled the other half of my vow.

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:43.650
Mm-hmm.

00:19:43.650 --> 00:19:45.170
I hope you fulfill it!

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:45.930
Ow!

00:19:45.930 --> 00:19:47.490
We're not here to “hope”!

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:48.940
What?

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:55.530
<i>Until then, take care!</i>
